msgid "SplineFit"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.SplineFit.SplineFit:1
msgid "Regroupe les paramètres de l'ajustement par spline."
msgstr "Groups the spline-fitting settings."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.SplineFit.SplineFit:3
msgid "Paramètres regroupés :"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.SplineFit.SplineFit:5
msgid "``Sensor`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`) : type de capteur, ``EMCCD`` ou ``sCMOS``."
msgstr "``Sensor`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`): sensor type, either ``EMCCD`` or ``sCMOS``."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.SplineFit.SplineFit:6
msgid "``Variance Map`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BrowseFile.BrowseFile`) : carte de variance du capteur sCMOS."
msgstr "``Variance Map`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BrowseFile.BrowseFile`): sCMOS sensor variance map."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.SplineFit.SplineFit:7
msgid "``File`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BrowseFile.BrowseFile`) : fichier de calibration de la fonction d'étalement du point."
msgstr "``File`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BrowseFile.BrowseFile`): point-spread-function calibration file."

